# Files the generator must not write. Patterns are matched against paths
# under its output dir; `**/` matches any directory prefix.
#
# Action and Event are internally tagged enums (`oneOf` + discriminator),
# which the Kotlin generator flattens into one data class with every
# variant's fields. :core defines them by hand as sealed interfaces and
# tests them against the Rust JSON fixtures instead (docs/ANDROID.md).
# ControlApi is the only API that uses them; the client talks to
# /clients/connect over its own WebSocket (marathon.core.RemoteSource).
**/models/Action.kt
**/models/ActionOneOf*.kt
**/models/ActionAccepted.kt
**/models/Direction.kt
**/models/Event.kt
**/models/EventOneOf*.kt
**/models/RelayedEvent.kt
**/apis/ControlApi.kt
